<div class="page">
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Improve pulp quality by extensive testing</div>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6;">
        <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> offers measurement systems for fiber analysis and tissue properties in several different forms. The customers' needs determine which method and instrument that is the most suitable.
